      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "When this unit is activated, pick one effect until the end of the activation: when shooting or charging enemies over 9 inches away, it gets either AP(\u002B1) or \u002B1 to hit rolls."
    },
    {
      "name": "Versatile Reach Aura",
      "passive": [
        {
          "hookID": "Lifecycle_OnUnitCreated",
